// Device signing configuration for the carApp application target.
//
// D-71 / ADR-0072 forbid committing a developer team, certificate or provisioning profile. Simulator
// builds and CI need none of them: Xcode signs the simulator application locally. Building for a
// physical device does need a team, so it is supplied by an untracked file next to this one.
//
// The optional include below is a no-op when that file is absent, which is the state of a fresh
// clone and of every CI runner. See docs/runbooks/ios-device-signing.md to create it.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
